# --- TB-HIST-12A: AR aging real-identity source files --------------------
# The founder-supplied "Jan 31, 2026 Aged AR listing.xlsx" (and any other
# real-member-identity AR workbook) MUST NEVER enter source control. Only
# sanitized workbooks with synthetic identities (CR-NNNN / Member NNNN)
# may live in tests/fixtures/ar-aging/.
tests/fixtures/ar-aging/*.real.*
tests/fixtures/ar-aging/sources/
tests/fixtures/ar-aging/*-REAL.*
# Repository-wide safety net — the founder's exact file name.
**/Jan*31*2026*Aged*AR*listing*.xlsx
**/Aged*AR*listing*.xlsx

# --- MEM-HIST-1 / MEM-HIST-2: Member Master real-identity source files ---
# The real Jonas Member Master export MUST NEVER enter source control.
# Only sanitized workbooks (per MEM-HIST-2 §1 — "Membership Master -
# Sanitized for Spectre.xlsx" with synthetic human names + preserved
# Jonas Member Numbers) may be used, and even those stay on the
# founder's workstation outside the repo.
tests/fixtures/member-master/*.real.*
tests/fixtures/member-master/sources/
tests/fixtures/member-master/*-REAL.*
# Repository-wide safety net — common Jonas export filename patterns.
**/Member*Master*.xlsx
**/Member*List*.xlsx
**/Members*Export*.xlsx
**/Membership*Master*.xlsx
**/Membership Master - Sanitized for Spectre.xlsx
# Founder's local sanitization salt — never commit.
.sanitize-salt
.sanitize-salt.*

